-# LCCC Benchmark Results — Phase 2 Status & Performance Report
-
-**Date:** 2026-03-19
-**LCCC commit:** `33ebb7bc` (Phase 2: Implement core linear scan register allocator, 2a-2d complete)
-**CCC commit:** `6f1b99ac` (upstream, without linear scan)
