-
-| Benchmark | LCCC | CCC | GCC |
-|-----------|------|-----|-----|
-| 01 Arith Loop | 14,520 B | 14,520 B | 16,080 B |
-| 02 Fibonacci | 14,520 B | 14,520 B | 16,064 B |
